# Firebase client config (e.g. APIs or Cloud Messaging)
#
# Mirrors android/.gitignore's treatment of google-services.json, and for the
# same reason: it is per-project client config rather than a credential, but a
# checked-in copy goes stale against the Firebase console silently. It is
# downloaded from Project settings -> Your apps -> iOS and dropped into
# App/App/ beside Info.plist, then added to the Xcode target.
#
# `GoogleService-Info.plist.example` is unaffected: this pattern does not match
# it, and the template stays tracked as the shape reference.
GoogleService-Info.plist
